  "details": "On occasion, like pretty often actually, I'll just load in as an error bot and will either automatically reload back into the avatar I should be or just won't reload at all? It also seems to be causing the issue where while I'm the error bot locally, remotely to other my animator will have issues as well and have me shown in a state it shouldn’t be in. It started happening like... several updates ago and unsure of if it's a me issue or otherwise.\nOutput log: https://gist.githubusercontent.com/SalbugVR/bb1d38f89f17014306cad88310748a8b/raw/69192f8df2183e69fed09b7f86341de0b17a9d03/gistfile1.txt",
